# Scratch output from running the collectors by hand, at the PACKAGE ROOT only.
#
# Every pattern is anchored with a leading slash. Unanchored, `transcripts/`
# matches a directory of that name at ANY depth, and git does not descend into
# an excluded directory — so `evidence/2026-09-09/transcripts/` was silently
# dropped from a commit that was meant to preserve it, with `git add -A`
# reporting success and four files staged out of 277.
/census-remote.json
/transcripts/
/tool-calls.json
/assessment.json
/oauth-census.json
